Show on both motors together — diagonal move running motor A at 60 and motor B at 60 mm/s at once (both at resonance; head moves in X and Y): defaults vs tuned tbl1_toff4_hstrt2_hend3_tpfd4 / tbl1_toff4_hstrt2_hend3_tpfd4

>> round 1/1  >> DEFAULTS — listen (both motors)

>> round 1/1  >> TUNED — listen (both motors)
   => both motors, defaults 93 -> tuned 81: 1.15x less vibration

both motors together: 1.15x less vibration overall

To see the gain of motor A, play only that motor: CHOPPER_DEMO MOTOR=A ROUNDS=1 REPEATS=1
To see the gain of motor B, play only that motor: CHOPPER_DEMO MOTOR=B ROUNDS=1 REPEATS=1
